//! name: defer-missing-semicolon-recovers
//! rule: 07.Recovery
//! expect: parse-error
//! detail: exactly one diagnostic ("missing `;`"): `defer` is in the statement synchronisation set, so the `;` is inserted virtually and both statements are in the CST

needs { };

fn f() { }
fn g() { }

fn a() {
    defer f() defer g();
}
